    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The claim `bar { ... }` has been making since it was" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// introduced, written out in full. `fills_meter()` reads the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// meter in force where it stands — 4/4 here, because this" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// piece writes no `meter` — and proves the passage is one" },
