    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// Three policies, three different claims. `exactly` is set" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// equality on pitch classes: every member sounds, and nothing" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// else does. Doubling is invisible to all three, because" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// which member is doubled is a fact about the voicing." },
